= The Cartridge Library

The ARCADIA-2001 was sold with a library of game cartridges “available at your
EMERSON dealer”. The FujiNet project keeps all 48 of them on the Internet,
ready to load: host *APPS.IRATA.ONLINE*, folder *ARCADIA* (Section 8). Each
loads in a second or two, and plays just as its own cartridge would.

