== Instructions

Each game’s own instruction booklet tells how to play it -- which overlay
goes on which controller, and what START, SELECT and OPTION do. Most games
use the console’s buttons the same way: SELECT picks the game number, OPTION
the skill, and START starts or restarts a game.

To play another game, go back to CONFIG (Section 5) and choose it.
